# Markdown files in this repo mix LaTeX (\(...\), \[...\], bare _subscripts_) with prose.
# Prettier's markdown printer treats bare "_" as CommonMark emphasis and rewrites it
# (e.g. \pi_{s,conv} -> \pi*{s,conv}), silently corrupting the math. Keep Prettier off
# Markdown entirely rather than trying to selectively allow it.
*.md
